{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id16198189"}, "name":{"label":"Beetboks"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2020-01-01T23:01:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5349972583"}, "title":{"label":"Fun while it lasted"}, "content":{"label":"Took a little under 2 hours to complete, but it was a great journey: it’s personality and presentation of emotion reminded me of a Pixar Short. The graphics, music and puzzles are all excellent with the only drawback being the controls, I frequently found myself “holding” a piece for too long to either place or drop it. While this was occasionally distracting and frustrating, it wasn’t enough to detract from the overall experience that I highly recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
