{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id786028089"}, "name":{"label":"TheTwinSociety"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-30T15:06:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5340375036"}, "title":{"label":"Most boring game I have every played..."}, "content":{"label":"The controls are terrible. The story is boring. The music is not exciting. It is repetitive. The puzzles are very easy. Very short. It does have very good graphics, though, but that it the only good thing.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id104082031"}, "name":{"label":"McCoyoioi"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-30T14:56:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5340349872"}, "title":{"label":"Good puzzles, fun game"}, "content":{"label":"This game was short and fun. My girlfriend (who has maybe never played a video game) and I completed this in a single sitting together. We played it on the iPad. It’s a perfect game for a touch screen.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1116135533"}, "name":{"label":"Sinodaqq"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-30T12:25:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5339971928"}, "title":{"label":"Great design, though controls are lacking"}, "content":{"label":"Builders Journey is a beautifully designed game with satisfying and interesting puzzles. Unfortunately the controls for changing puzzle pieces are a bit frustrating, as you are required to fully focus on dropping them before picking up a new one. There is a huge amount of potential for a truly special experience here; between the crisp visual design and minimalist storytelling I am very close to falling in love with this game if not for the poor efficiency of the touch controls.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id18420134"}, "name":{"label":"sarahfelldown"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-30T10:06:36-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5339602009"}, "title":{"label":"Objective?"}, "content":{"label":"Super fun game where there’s no instruction and you just try to place four LEGO pieces in diner order that lets you advance, but that never happens.\n\nI know games without instructions or clues are THE THING right now, but this is dumb and disappointing. Wanted to play longer than 10 minutes, but if I don’t know what the objective is then ¯\\_(ツ)_/¯", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
