{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id13900872"}, "name":{"label":"gumbright"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-28T21:09:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5333218063"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty game? Yes. Good game? No."}, "content":{"label":"I really wanted to like this more. But it is SO uneven. Some puzzles make sense but some a pure trial and error (talking to you ‘building a castle’). Seriously, what is the “right” way to build something when you are just given a pile of bricks?\nPointless filling the same thing over and over, boring pattern completion, etc.\n\nI have said this before: a good puzzle makes sense. So far, a lot of these don’t. There are lots of good mechanics here but poorly used, mud being a example.\n\nAddendum: more I play worse it gets. Now am stuck on a “machine” level and the other yellow has not regenerated so I am stuck", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id22792692"}, "name":{"label":"Rexxar CH Lin"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-28T16:07:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5332385633"}, "title":{"label":"Incredibly enjoyable game"}, "content":{"label":"The puzzles are great and there is almost always more than one way to solve them, albeit not obvious what is required at first.  It’s a shame that it’s such a short game.  I look forward to other games like this in the future.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
