{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43331140"}, "name":{"label":"Tinman313"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-27T08:43:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5326883189"}, "title":{"label":"Amazing but short"}, "content":{"label":"I was very surprised that I reached the end so quickly. It’s An amazingly built game and so relaxing and satisfying. Highly recommend! Please release more levels or a part 2!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id33062204"}, "name":{"label":"scottmiller99"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-26T21:21:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5324728177"}, "title":{"label":"Almost Perfect"}, "content":{"label":"Fun puzzler! Only complaints a couple complaints. \n\nIf I rotate the screen to a different view, it rotates back to the original position after just a couple seconds. Would be nice to be able to rotate to another angle and stay there. \n\nOn some levels, it would be nice to be able to zoom in or out.\n\nMore levels please!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id10253344"}, "name":{"label":"Daftmousr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-26T08:02:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5322408226"}, "title":{"label":"Charming but needs better camera controls"}, "content":{"label":"Game is charming but it desperately needs buttons for actual camera controls. It’s frustrating to rotate the camera for a better view of where I want to place a brick only for the camera to reset to the default view when I grab it.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28898067"}, "name":{"label":"Ethan Vincent"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T21:27:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5320437084"}, "title":{"label":"Patience, slow play and discovery"}, "content":{"label":"Builder’s Journey is a new way of LEGO gameplay. Aesthetically pleasing with a melancholic soundtrack and father-son storyline, the idea is to understand each puzzle and solve it with LEGO bricks in a new and innovative way. The final level may require some thinking and patience...the payoff may feel a tad anticlimactic, but overall, this gaming experience was fun and kept me at it unlike other Apple Arcade games. It’s exciting to see LEGO creating games with high design standards and in the vein of Monument Valley and other acclaimed games.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id669665427"}, "name":{"label":"OTFTYT"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T19:29:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5320131925"}, "title":{"label":"Best game"}, "content":{"label":"Its perfect! I love this mini adventure. It’s so perfect; it doesn’t even need names for characters! I can feel for them in this adventure of tap and hold. Its very creative and gets me thinking sometimes. Definitely a great puzzle game for strong thinkers. Recommend for people of all ages to enjoy!!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id212971809"}, "name":{"label":"proTARHEELfan"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T14:48:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5319414379"}, "title":{"label":"Okay but age range is wrong and the game is really short"}, "content":{"label":"I do like the functionality for myself to play. The game is way to frustrating and hard for my 6yo daughter though. With my help we beat the game in about 45 minutes. Lego games are the only reason that I purchased Apple Arcade and this one has definitely dropped the ball on many levels. \nI am hopeful that they will work out the controls for version 2 and have an age selection that will make the game more appropriate based on the age of the user.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id42006583"}, "name":{"label":"TronWeasley"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T13:19:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5319179401"}, "title":{"label":"Captures spirit of LEGO."}, "content":{"label":"This game does a better job of capturing the true spirit of LEGO than most of the brand games because I never really had a plan or knew what I was doing but I just put stuff together and it’s it all worked out. \n\nAlso those light effects 😙👌", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id17634294"}, "name":{"label":"Jamcat1190"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T11:30:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5318868521"}, "title":{"label":"I feel like an idiot"}, "content":{"label":"Why isn’t there any instructions on what to do?Am I supposed to magically know what to build without a picture to work off of? What’s the purpose of of the flashing blue tiles on the left side...other being distracting? Why can’t I rotate the platform to see where to place the blocks? What are the poles on the sides for?", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id154239159"}, "name":{"label":"L8rG8r400"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-25T09:45:06-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5318538673"}, "title":{"label":"Moderately enjoyable"}, "content":{"label":"A strange, but welcome diversion from the types of games we usually expect from the Lego brand. Not very substantial from a content perspective, with 40 relatively short levels that can be completed in just a few hours. The story is a somewhat nonsensical series of vignettes, that didn’t always make sense to me, but the game seems to be more focused on providing a zen-like, meditative experience. Worth a shot if you are into games like that.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
