{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id535309004"}, "name":{"label":"Ayoush Mukherjee"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2019-12-24T04:17:20-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.0"}, "id":{"label":"5313031175"}, "title":{"label":"Good puzzles; controls could be better"}, "content":{"label":"The puzzles are good in that they require just the right amount of thinking in order to be able to complete them without having to fully focus on them. So it’s a good way to pass time. The controls however are not the best to make precise placements for the blocks.\n\nMy biggest peeve is that we can only work with one POV instead of being able to spin the level around.\n\nAlso the game is really short.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=1441636691&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"2"}}, 
